🧠 SO WHAT IS NAYA POWER ULTIMATELY?
After going through the architecture at this level, I'd sharpen my earlier answer.
Naya Power is not fundamentally:
a chatbot
a Hub
a Smart Note system
an Activity Feed
a collection of agents
a GitHub repository
a website
a memory system
an automation system
Those are components or manifestations.
The deeper thing is:
Naya Power is a governed intelligence-and-continuity system that allows humans and AI to turn intent into increasingly reliable action, preserve what was learned, verify what actually happened, and carry the resulting intelligence forward into the next decision.
Or even simpler:
Naya Power is a machine for making human–AI intelligence compound.
